    "en": {
      "trackName": "Mini Dou Dizhu:Watch Cards",
      "description": "Play Dou Dizhu, the classic three-player Chinese card game, offline on iPhone and Apple Watch. Bid to become the landlord, plan your combinations and help your side empty a hand first. No internet connection or account needed.\n\nCLASSIC PLAY, HELPFUL HINTS\nChallenge two computer opponents with singles, pairs, straights, consecutive triples, bombs and rockets. Built-in rules and move hints help you learn the game and try different tactics.\n\nA CARD TABLE ON YOUR WRIST\nPlay independently on Apple Watch. Bid, choose cards, make your move and finish a full round right on your wrist.\n\nA NEW DEAL EVERY DAY\nDaily Challenge gives you a fixed deal for the day. Replay the same cards, change your approach and explore a better order of play.\n\nPASS ONE DEVICE, PLAY WITH FRIENDS\nThree people can take turns on the same device. Hands stay hidden during handoffs, so each player can reveal their cards when ready.\n\nSMALL GOALS, SATISFYING PROGRESS\nComplete daily tasks, collect achievements and track your games and wins. Friendly characters, floating islands and a warm wooden table make every visit feel inviting.\n\nNINE LANGUAGES\nChoose English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish, French, German or Italian. Follow your system language or switch in the app.\n\nProgress is saved locally on each device and does not sync between iPhone and Apple Watch. Pass & Play is for three people sharing one device. In-game coins track progress and have no cash value.",
      "releaseNotes": "",
